WEBVTT

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:08.233
A workflow decides what happens to your words.

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:09.200
Let's build one!

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:13.467
Pick what you want back.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:15.000
Today: an email reply.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.167
Try It Out runs a test first.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.833
Nothing gets sent, nothing gets inserted.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:28.167
Now, when should it run?

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:33.967
It runs automatically whenever you dictate in Mail.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.433
Then just hit save.

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:45.300
“Um, tell Anna thanks for the update.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.400
Thursday works for me, and I'll bring the slides.”

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.467
Rough notes go in, a polished reply comes out.

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.600
Need something different?

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.800
Just pick another template.

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.400
Run it in an app, on a website,

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.100
with a hotkey, always, or from the palette.

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:07.067
Workflows.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.333
Your words, your way!
